  "_comment": [
    "The spread's shape (effects plan D4, section 3.3 steps 1-5) over notional heads, element i at",
    "position i/(heads-1) (0.5 for one head): each head's phase offset and the slot count after step 4.",
    "Read by fx/SpreadShapeTest.kt (DistributionPlan.forElements) and frontend/src/lib/spreadShape.test.ts.",
    "An absent spread, wings, segments or parts is its default: 1.0, 1, 1, 0 (off). Offsets compare to 1e-9.",
    "Random is SpreadOrder.RANDOM's default seed 0.",
    "A case with `over` is one element mode over `fixtures` fixtures of `elementsEach` elements: `heads` is the units the spread counts (the dials), and SpreadShapeTest checks every element takes its unit's offset.",
    "A case with `spreadUnit: STEP` counts `spread` in the FX's own `steps` (fx-settings plan D6): offset = spread x rank / steps, on the ranks Segments, Wings and Parts leave."
